OL,3,GNEWSANoah Donohoe inquest expected to
OL,4,Areturn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe long-running Noah Donohoe inquest
OL,7,Fis expected to return on Monday.
OL,9,FThe inquest was adjourned at the start
OL,10,Fof July due to holiday arrangements of
OL,11,Ffour members of the jury.
OL,13,FIt had been examining the circumstances
OL,14,Fof Noah's death after he disappeared
OL,15,Fand died in north Belfast in June 2020.
OL,17,FHis body was found in an underground
OL,18,Fwater tunnel close to the M2 motorway
OL,19,Fsix days after he went missing.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
